"""
AUTONOMOUS TRADING ORCHESTRATOR - NO SERVER NEEDED
===================================================
A fully autonomous trading system that is TIME-AWARE and knows what to do.

This is THE BRAIN that replaces the web server. It:
1. Knows what time it is (market phase detection)
2. Runs the right workflow at the right time:
   - OVERNIGHT: Research, optimize, learn
   - PREMARKET: Run scans, validate picks
   - MARKET HOURS: Run day manager
   - PM WORKFLOW: Post-market analysis, generate signals
3. Diagnoses and fixes its own errors
4. Caches research to avoid redundant API calls
5. Detects and cleans up odd lot positions
6. Generates actionable trade plans with stops/targets

USAGE:
  python -m autotrade.core.autonomous_agent --scheduled           # FULL AUTO (dry run)
  python -m autotrade.core.autonomous_agent --scheduled --execute # LIVE TRADING
  python -m autotrade.core.autonomous_agent --workflow-validate   # Deterministic workflow validation
  python -m autotrade.core.autonomous_agent --status              # Show schedule status
  python -m autotrade.core.autonomous_agent --plan                # Generate tomorrow's plan
  python -m autotrade.core.autonomous_agent --positions           # Show positions + odd lots

AI MODEL POLICY:
- All research uses LOCAL Ollama models (qwen3:8b)
- Web search uses SearXNG with caching + relevance + freshness filtering
- OpenAI is LAST RESORT only (for large refactoring)
- Code debugging uses Ollama (NOT OpenAI)

IMPORTANT: qwen3 models require "think": False in API calls
or they return empty content.

MODULE ARCHITECTURE MAP

PHASE 1 – SUPPORT INFRASTRUCTURE (Lines 1-3500)
    - Data Models: AgentState, MarketPhase, ResearchTask
    - Core Utilities: MarketScheduler, ErrorDiagnoser
    - Data Layer: DataFetcher, WebResearcher
    - Analysis Support: WatchlistOptimizer, BacktestAnalyzer
    - Development: CodeDebugger, TomorrowsPlanGenerator

PHASE 2 – RESEARCH ENGINE (Lines 3500-6000)
    - OvernightResearchEngine: Handles core signal generation and multi-step research.

PHASE 3 – AGENT ORCHESTRATION (Lines 6000-9000)
    - AutonomousAgent Class Initialization
    - Task Routing & Modular Integrations
    - Workflow Health Monitoring & Self-Healing (The "Immune System")
    - Model Infrastructure (Ollama/OpenAI Management)

PHASE 4 – TASK EXECUTION & RUNTIME LOGIC (Lines 9000-12000)
    - Task Lifecycle Management (add_task, process_task)
    - Continuous Operation Loop (run_continuous)
    - Secondary/Idle Jobs (Post-plan tasks, VL Benchmarking)

PHASE 5 – TRADING CYCLE WORKFLOWS (Lines 12000-17000)
    - Overnight Research Cycle (_run_overnight_cycle)
    - Watchlist Selection & Ranking Logic
    - Market Phase Transitions (Open, Hours, Post-Market)
    - Premarket Gap Analysis & Strategy Adjustments

PHASE 6 – SYSTEM ENTRY POINTS (Lines 17000-18000)
    - Scheduler (run_scheduled)
    - Main CLI Loop (main, _main_inner)
"""

